<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BARCELONA WIN SPANISH SUPER CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA WIN SPANISH SUPER CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Spanish Super Cup, second leg, played on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Atletico Madrid	  3    Barcelona	   1</p>
<p>(Barcelona win 6-5 on aggregate)</p>
</text>
